>>
Rule 1 (input must be a (batch) matrix: rank of a ≥ 2)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 2 (well-formed shape: all defined dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 3 (conjugation is not applied to string tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : bool} |= (v_3 = false) ∨ (dtype_(v_1) ≠ 11)
>>
Rule 4 (name is an unconstrained optional string)
{v_2 : str} |= (v_2 = "none") ∨ (v_2 ≠ "none")
